      "content": "i don't know... the hospital is like a 45 min drive and the wait times are always insane. i really dont want to spend all night in an ER if i'm just having a panic attack. is there anything i can take right now to just calm my heart rate down and make the pain stop so i can sleep it off? like maybe something stronger than ibuprofen?",
